{# THE HEAD OF ONE LIST IN THE RAIL: where it sits, what it is, and how many
   it holds.

   A LIST STATES ITS OWN COUNT, because the rail carries several and a
   reader scrolling the third has lost sight of how long the first was. The
   count is of the WHOLE list, not of the rows one sub-head happens to
   hold. #}
<div class="rl-cellhd">
    <span class="ord"><b>{{ position }}</b></span>
    <span class="k">{{ list.label }}</span>
    <em>{{ list.count }}</em>
    <span class="sp"></span>
</div>
